From a2a1c0baf71bdc738fca84fead703afe28599f64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 02:08:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Website Developer role, roster divisions, custom permissions,
 password settings, account recovery, Discord OAuth2 and invite

